<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Amazon Bestselling Books: Price vs. User Rating Trend Analysis (2009–2019)</h1>

        <p><strong>Executive Summary:</strong> This report analyzes the dynamics between book pricing and user ratings across the top 50 bestselling books on Amazon each year from 2009 to 2019. It provides data-informed insights for publishers and retailers regarding pricing strategy, catalog curation, and genre investment.</p>

        <h2 id="market-overview">1. Bestseller Market Overview (2009–2019)</h2>
